### Event Booking API - demo requests (IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Run requests IN ORDER (1 -> 12). Tokens and the event id are saved automatically
### by the "> {% ... %}" scripts and reused by later requests.
### Re-running from the top? Change the two emails in 1 and 2 (or you'll get 409).

@base = https://event-booking-api-be40.onrender.com
#@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register an organizer
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Olivia Organizer", "email": "olivia3@example.com", "password": "secret123", "role": "ORGANIZER" }

> {% client.global.set("orgToken", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Register a customer (use a REAL inbox you can show in the video)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Your Name", "email": "rochasvarma123+t2@gmail.com", "password": "secret123", "role": "CUSTOMER" }

> {% client.global.set("custToken", response.body.token); %}

### 3. Organizer creates an event
POST {{base}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{orgToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Tech Meetup  2026", "description": "Talks + pizza", "venue": "Bengaluru Hall A",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-20T18:00:00+05:30", "totalTickets": 100 }

> {% client.global.set("eventId", response.body.id); %}

### 4. RBAC check: customer tries to create an event -> 403
POST {{base}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{custToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Nope", "venue": "x", "startsAt": "2026-12-20T18:00:00+05:30", "totalTickets": 5 }

### 5. Anyone can browse events (no token)
GET {{base}}/api/events?q=tech

### 6. Customer books 2 tickets -> Background Task 1 sends the confirmation email
POST {{base}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{custToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 2 }

> {% client.global.set("bookingId", response.body.id); %}

### 7. Customer's bookings
GET {{base}}/api/bookings/me
Authorization: Bearer {{custToken}}

### 8. Organizer updates the event -> Background Task 2 emails every ticket holder
PATCH {{base}}/api/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{orgToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "venue": "Bengaluru Hall  B (bigger room!)", "startsAt": "2026-12-20T19:00:00+05:30" }

### 9. Customer's in-app notifications (wait ~2s after 8)
GET {{base}}/api/notifications/me
Authorization: Bearer {{custToken}}

### 10. Organizer sees bookings for the event
GET {{base}}/api/organizer/events/{{eventId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{orgToken}}

### 11. Job queue + email log stats (proof emails were sent)
GET {{base}}/api/organizer/ops/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{orgToken}}

### 12. Which performance profile is running?
GET {{base}}/
